亲的龙门传承，他才知道，自己是当世龙子，金鳞怎是池中物，一遇风云便化龙……\n　　从今日，我要这天，再遮不住我眼， 要这地，再埋不了我心……\n　　我楚阳，今日发誓，碾压这世间一切不公……","freeType":1,"categoryId":105000,"authorName":"青龙","allWords":4624959,"coverUrl":"http://scdn.taoyuewenhua.net/app/cover/75bbece6fea2b152e59ad4157706647d.jpg","bigCoverUrl":"http://scdn.taoyuewenhua.net/app/bcover/11721dee8dd0420010a763c9a3ba046b.jpg","categoryName":"都市","createTime":1742289348000,"chapterSize":1951,"recommend":"推荐-11-男频","recommendId":"recommend-1794923361:11:1:1000:n","status":50,"completeOn":1742289348000,"score":80,"offline":0,"issue":0,"searchOffline":0,"cpName":"第三方","rank":9,"goReading":true,"tagList":["赘婿","都市修真","复仇","打脸","热血","爽文"],"mainTagList":["赘婿","都市修真"],"hintTagList":[],"roleList":[],"boostKeywordList":[],"chargeType":0,"chargeChapterIdx":17,"latestChapterUpdateTime":1742289348000,"latestChapter":"第1951章 世外逍遥","latestChapterId":"jz_119294"}]}}